PROJECT: Cardano

## Market Category

Primary Category: Layer 1 Blockchain
Secondary Category: Smart Contract Platform
Sector: Blockchain Infrastructure
Sub-sector: Proof-of-Stake / eUTXO / Academic-Research-Driven / On-Chain Governance
Sources: (HIGH) [Cardano Foundation, https://cardano.org]; (HIGH) [Messari, https://messari.io/asset/cardano]; (HIGH) [DefiLlama, https://defillama.com/chain/Cardano]; (HIGH) [CoinGecko, https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/cardano]

## Market Position

Project Stage: Mature
Primary Competitors: Ethereum, Solana, Avalanche, Polkadot, BNB Chain, Tron, Near, Algorand, Tezos, Cosmos Hub
Market Segment: General-purpose programmable Layer 1 with focus on formal verification, academic research, on-chain governance, and enterprise identity (Atala PRISM)
Geographic Focus: Global (strong historical retail base in Japan from voucher sale; growing enterprise/government partnerships in Africa/Europe via Atala PRISM; developer hubs in US, Europe, Kenya, Argentina)
Sources: (HIGH) [Messari Cardano Profile, https://messari.io/asset/cardano]; (HIGH) [CoinGecko Cardano, https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/cardano]; (HIGH) [DefiLlama Chains, https://defillama.com/chains]; (HIGH) [Atala PRISM Case Studies, https://atalaprism.io/case-studies/]; (HIGH) [Cardano Summit 2022 Nation-State Partnerships, https://cardanosummit.io/]

