## Liquidity

Liquidity Source: Centralized Exchanges (CEX)
Major Liquidity Venue: Binance (highest spot and perpetual volume), Coinbase (highest USD fiat volume), Kraken (high EUR volume), OKX, Bybit
DEX: Minswap (largest DEX by TVL and volume on Cardano), WingRiders, SundaeSwap, VyFi, Spectrum, DexHunter (aggregator)
Bridge Liquidity: Wanchain Bridge (ADA ↔ ETH/BSC/Polygon), cBridge/Celer (ADA ↔ 30+ EVM chains), Milkomeda C1 Bridge (ADA ↔ milkADA on EVM sidechain)
Status: High liquidity on major CEXs (top 10 asset by volume typically); DEX liquidity concentrated in top 3-4 protocols; bridge liquidity growing but fragmented across multiple bridges
Sources: (HIGH) [CoinGecko Markets ADA, https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/cardano#markets]; (HIGH) [DefiLlama Cardano DEXs, https://defillama.com/chain/Cardano]; (HIGH) [Wanchain Bridge, https://www.wanchain.org/cardano/]; (HIGH) [Celer cBridge Cardano, https://cbridge.celer.network/]; (HIGH) [Milkomeda Bridge, https://milkomeda.com/bridge]

